# N4 slice 1, staged (LMX_semantics.ru.md #fields; plan A2): a data closed by until keeps its root declarations with
# a computed initializer inside its loop, so the place y of D is no child of D and a row of child indexes cannot
# address it. Refused at the data operand until place rows with paths exist.
int: n 0
fn: give () int
    node\n: node\n + 1
    return: 40
end: give
S:
    int: y
    y: y + 2
end: S
D:
    int: x 1
    int: y give()
until: n > 0
call: S D
return
